1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:01,533
(Amy:)You know, Sheldon,

2
00:00:01,538 --> 00:00:04,108
(Amy:)instead of fixating
on what Bert has,

3
00:00:04,108 --> 00:00:05,078
(Amy:)you should appreciate

4
00:00:05,075 --> 00:00:07,045
(Amy:)all of the good things
in your life.

5
00:00:07,044 --> 00:00:08,544
Y-You've got love,

6
00:00:08,545 --> 00:00:09,815
(Amy:)you're in good health,

7
00:00:09,813 --> 00:00:11,213
(Amy:)you've got a roof
over your head.

8
00:00:11,215 --> 00:00:12,385
(Leonard:)Yeah,

9
00:00:12,383 --> 00:00:14,183
(Sheldon:)but you've got all those things,

10
00:00:14,184 --> 00:00:16,184
(Sheldon:)and no one's lining up
to be you.

11
00:00:18,589 --> 00:00:19,819
(Amy:)Anybody else want to try?

12
00:00:19,823 --> 00:00:20,893
(Amy:)I'm gonna go
make some more tea

13
00:00:20,891 --> 00:00:22,261
(Amy:)and question
my life choices.

14
00:00:24,027 --> 00:00:25,057
(Leonard:)You're up.

15
00:00:26,497 --> 00:00:30,237
(Penny:)This is getting old fast,
Dolores, knock it off!

16
00:00:31,101 --> 00:00:32,601
(Sheldon:)Uh, do you really think

17
00:00:32,603 --> 00:00:33,703
(Sheldon:)calling me names is helpful?

18
00:00:33,704 --> 00:00:34,634
I do!

19
00:00:34,638 --> 00:00:36,868
(Penny:)Your life is fine,
you big baby!

20
00:00:36,874 --> 00:00:38,404
(Sheldon:)Maybe you're right.

21
00:00:38,409 --> 00:00:39,779
Really?!

22
00:00:41,011 --> 00:00:42,811
(Leonard:)If it helps,
I'm questioning

23
00:00:42,813 --> 00:00:45,013
(Leonard:)your life choices, too.

24
00:00:45,015 --> 00:00:46,315
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Penny.

25
00:00:46,316 --> 00:00:47,986
(Sheldon:)You know, I just need
to keep reminding myself

26
00:00:47,985 --> 00:00:50,615
(Sheldon:)that Bert's success
is not my failure.

27
00:00:50,621 --> 00:00:51,691
(Penny:)There you go.

28
00:00:51,688 --> 00:00:53,018
(Sheldon:)And that men
of his large stature

29
00:00:53,023 --> 00:00:54,693
(Sheldon:)are more susceptible
to a wide array

30
00:00:54,691 --> 00:00:57,391
(Sheldon:)of life-threatening diseases.

31
00:00:57,394 --> 00:01:04,024
(Penny:)There you go...

